[2026-02-02T19:45:54.545+0000] {docker.py:429} INFO - 2026-02-02 19:45:54 [scrapy.core.scraper] DEBUG: Scraped from <200 https://www.riminitoday.it/eventi/l-universo-di-jane-austen-viaggio-tra-letteratura-rito-del-te-e-atmosfere-d-epoca.html>
