[2026-02-02T19:45:59.782+0000] {docker.py:429} INFO - 2026-02-02 19:45:59 [scrapy.core.scraper] DEBUG: Scraped from <200 https://www.riminitoday.it/eventi/foto-grafando-viaggio-nella-storia-della-fotografia.html>
{'category': ['Incontri'],
 'city': 'Rimini',
