[2026-02-02T19:46:01.796+0000] {docker.py:429} INFO - 2026-02-02 19:46:01 [scrapy.core.scraper] DEBUG: Scraped from <200 https://www.riminitoday.it/eventi/riparte-mentre-vivevo-la-zona-d-interesse-kronoteatro-e-rosa-matteucci.html>
{'category': ['Incontri'],
